<title>USA: Individual Inc names new senior vp.</title>
<headline>Individual Inc names new senior vp.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Individual Inc said Tuesday it named Michael Kraley to the newly created position of senior vice president of engineering and chief technology officer at the electronic-information service company.</p>
<p>Until recently, Kraley was vice president of development and operations at AT&amp;T Corp unit AT&amp;T New Media Services and its predecessor company, Ziff-Davis Interactive.</p>
